  "requiredCodeAndActualFollowup": [
    "Root must explicitly append-freeze exact5d2f/df16/H4650 before implementing these constructor changes; original G1B approval is not silently widened.",
    "Code review must show current source/closure pins are checked before first untrusted module import, fixed actual original factory/view function identities, no top-level task execution, no callable registrar or user-selected module.",
    "Use own-property descriptors and util.types.isProxy before any untrusted getters. Snapshot only closed primitive options; preserve planned-date exactly. Missing date is rejected only where the original specific caller requires it; native factory cannot infer phase or synthesize a date.",
    "Private synchronous construction frame is exactly scoped to one fixed constructor call, rejects nested/reentrant calls, cleans up on throws before partial/after partial/before real return, and never leaves a reachable brand on failed construction.",
    "Genuine real returned state/method identity and protected Root/view relation must be tested at real module seams. BaseReg5 must be verified as immutable data rather than invoking attacker getters/proxies. Root/view/JSON/partial/public reference cannot exchange or mint private current authority.",
    "Three new driver MODs are limited to the explicit fixed import and callee substitution; original arguments including conditional planned-date remain byte-identical. Witness existing MOD may use fixed createWitnessView121 while facts284 view implementation stays raw-identical.",
    "All original financial/FI/normal/wait/CAS/target/receipt algorithms and non121 behavior remain protected; no added leaf, H3 count, validation entry or business scope.",
